<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79659" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρνοψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οπος</span>, ὁ, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>locust</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρνοψ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				150
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				588
			</span></i>, Nicophoi, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				6.19
			</span></i> :—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παρνόπιος</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλων</span>, <i>averter of
			locusts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.24.8
			</span></i> : also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παρνοπίων</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.64
			</span></i> ; as name of a month among the Aeolians of Asia, ibid. (nisi
			leg. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πορν-</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πορνόπιος</span>
			).</div>
